Process Flow:-
flowchart TD
    A([Start Application]) --> B[Initialize ArrayList & Sample Data]
    B --> C[Display Console Menu]
    C --> D[Prompt User Input]
    D --> E{Valid Input?}
    E -- No / Exception --> F[Display Error Message] --> C
    E -- Yes --> G{Select Choice}
    G -- 1: View Students --> H[Iterate list & call display] --> C
